								"html": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<strong>Join Our Advisory Board and Make a Lasting Impact</strong>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tAre you passionate about creating meaningful change in our community? The Salvation Army Hampton Roads Area Command is seeking dedicated leaders to serve on our Advisory Board . Individuals must be ready to share their time, talents, and influence to help us meet urgent needs and uplift lives across the region. Our Advisory Board members play a critical role in guiding the mission and strategic direction of The Salvation Army locally. From supporting fundraising initiatives to providing community insight and advocacy, our advisory board members serve as ambassadors for hope, compassion, and service.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<strong>By joining the Advisory Board, you can:</strong>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tHelp shape programs that serve thousands of families each year\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tAdvocate for solutions to hunger, homelessness, and poverty\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tUse your professional skills to strengthen organizational impact\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tNetwork with other community-minded leaders\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tIf you are ready to make a difference and want to learn more about becoming an Advisory Board member, we invite you to reach out today. Please complete our Advisory Board Interest Form by clicking the button below.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://forms.office.com/r/YF8zkCs51G\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Advisory Board Interest Form</a></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tIf you have any additional questions, please contact Beth Hornby, Development Director at <a href=\"mailto:beth.hornby@uss.salvationarmy.org\">beth.hornby@uss.salvationarmy.org</a> or call <a href=\"tel:7572718431\">757-271-8431</a>.\n</p></div>",
